+msgid "### Planner Responsibilities"
+msgstr "### 规划器职责"
+
+msgid "The planner treats the seed key as an opaque compatibility identifier. RFork derives it from the model/configuration fingerprint, the structural digest of transferable tensors, and shard topology. A planner should:"
+msgstr "规划器将 seed 键视为不透明的兼容性标识符。RFork 根据模型/配置指纹、可传输张量的结构摘要和分片拓扑生成该键。规划器应："
+
+msgid "- Match exact seed keys, track seed availability through heartbeats, and expire stale advertisements.\n- Allocate leases according to seed capacity, accept lease releases, and reclaim abandoned or expired leases.\n- Make seed selection and lease state observable for operations."
+msgstr "- 按 seed 键精确匹配，通过心跳跟踪 seed 可用性，并清理过期的 seed 广告。\n- 根据 seed 容量分配租约、接受租约释放，并回收遗留或已过期的租约。\n- 提供 seed 选择和租约状态的可观测信息，便于运维。"
+
+msgid "Lease release is asynchronous. An unresolved release delays advertising the receiver as a seed, but does not block inference. The bundled planner is a functional example, not a production scheduler."
+msgstr "租约释放以异步方式进行。尚未解决的释放会延迟将接收端发布为 seed，但不会阻塞推理。随附的规划器是功能示例，并非生产级调度器。"
+
